    <briefdescription>
<para>Return a reference to the first or second member of a reference. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Otherwise, return a copy of the member of a temporary.</para>
<para>When passing a range whose iterators return values instead of references, the reference must be dropped from <computeroutput>decltype((elt.first))</computeroutput>, which will always be a reference, to avoid returning a reference to a temporary. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
